      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ESCAPING TIME (1) was quickly into stride on debut to score by half a length (22.82) at Mandurah over 400m. Drawn to take advantage of good early pace. Tougher here but can go on with it. BAND FOR BAND (2) found traffic in the run and collided, missing the frame when a 67 length sixth (26.39) at this track in a Novice race. Better than last start and can bounce back. TIDE IS HIGH (8) is an honest type in the frame at four of eight starts including last time when second (22.35) over 381m at this track. Super consistent and can feature with the right run. JUMBO KEEPING (7) cannot be written off despite a miss here at his latest outing.",
